---
// CBT cycle diagram for /therapies/cbt/: thought → feeling → behavior, each feeding the next.
---
<figure class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[420px]" aria-label="Diagram: a thought shapes a feeling, the feeling drives a behavior, and the behavior reinforces the thought">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 400 360" class="h-auto w-full" role="presentation">
    <defs>
      <marker id="cbt-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="var(--color-gold)" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <path d="M232 72 Q320 120 330 232" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-gold)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#cbt-arrow)" />
    <path d="M280 306 Q200 336 120 306" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-gold)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#cbt-arrow)" />
    <path d="M70 232 Q80 120 168 72" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-gold)" stroke-width="3" marker-end="url(#cbt-arrow)" />
    <g font-family="var(--font-sans)" text-anchor="middle">
      <circle cx="200" cy="62" r="54" fill="var(--color-teal)" />
      <text x="200" y="58" fill="#fff" font-size="19" font-weight="800">Thought</text>
      <text x="200" y="80" fill="#fff" font-size="11">“I can’t cope”</text>
      <circle cx="330" cy="280" r="54" fill="var(--color-teal-light)" />
      <text x="330" y="276" fill="#fff" font-size="19" font-weight="800">Feeling</text>
      <text x="330" y="298" fill="#fff" font-size="12">panic, shame</text>
      <circle cx="70" cy="280" r="54" fill="var(--color-teal-deep)" />
      <text x="70" y="276" fill="#fff" font-size="19" font-weight="800">Behavior</text>
      <text x="70" y="298" fill="#fff" font-size="12">reaching to use</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-sm text-muted">Change one point in the cycle, and the others start to shift.</figcaption>
</figure>
